    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't Play This</strong> is a first-person indie horror in the walking simulator genre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319120/extras/2d1fad337baf5f7f62d9777549ca022a.avif?t=1753362937\" width=640 height=82 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319120/extras/1db574fef06012c6ce4da2bd07f123a5.poster.avif?t=1753362937\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319120/extras/1db574fef06012c6ce4da2bd07f123a5.webm?t=1753362937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319120/extras/1db574fef06012c6ce4da2bd07f123a5.mp4?t=1753362937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > People often record videos on camera that become the last for them.\u00a0 You will have to relive these moments and experience what cut the record off forever. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319120/extras/a917ab07edd8ab45d54a57dbd9c50393.poster.avif?t=1753362937\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319120/extras/a917ab07edd8ab45d54a57dbd9c50393.webm?t=1753362937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319120/extras/a917ab07edd8ab45d54a57dbd9c50393.mp4?t=1753362937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to go through several different locations, constantly encountering the horrors that inhabit them. Beautiful graphics and high-quality 3D sound will help you fully experience the atmosphere of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Walking simulator;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - First-person view;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - A variety of visual styles;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attention! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.</p>",
